1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,585
Puri ke mandir ka jhanda hawa ke ulte udta hai,

2
00:00:03,585 --> 00:00:06,453
aisa log kehte hain. Samundar se hawa aaye,

3
00:00:06,453 --> 00:00:09,321
phir bhi jhanda samundar ki taraf lehraata hai.

4
00:00:09,321 --> 00:00:12,548
Sadiyon se pilgrims yeh dekh kar haath jodte hain.

5
00:00:12,548 --> 00:00:16,850
Aur aaj mausam vigyani bhi is jhande ko dhyan se dekhte hain.

6
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,637
Yeh akela rahasya nahi hai.

7
00:00:18,637 --> 00:00:21,855
Kehte hain mandir ki parchhai zameen par nahi dikhti.

8
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:25,430
Shikhar ka chakra har disha se aapko hi dekhta hai.

9
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:28,647
Rasoi mein sabse upar ka matka pehle pakta hai.

10
00:00:28,647 --> 00:00:32,580
Singhadwara paar karte hi samundar ki awaaz chup ho jaati hai.

11
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:36,514
Is video mein har rahasya ke saath dono pehlu milenge.

12
00:00:36,514 --> 00:00:40,448
Ek taraf bhakt ki shraddha, doosri taraf vigyan ka hisaab.

13
00:00:40,448 --> 00:00:44,382
Hum kisi ko galat nahi kahenge. Hum bas sabut rakhenge,

14
00:00:44,382 --> 00:00:48,710
aur faisla aapka hoga. Chaliye, Odisha ke samundar kinare chalte hain.

15
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:51,534
Pehle dekhte hain ki granth kya kehte hain.

16
00:00:51,534 --> 00:00:54,357
Skanda Purana ka ek hissa hai, Utkala Khanda.

17
00:00:54,357 --> 00:00:55,769
Utkala yaani purana Odisha.

18
00:00:55,769 --> 00:00:59,652
Is hisse mein Puri ki mahima vistaar se likhi gayi hai.

19
00:00:59,652 --> 00:01:02,122
Aur yahan ek baat bahut khaas hai,

20
00:01:02,122 --> 00:01:04,240
jo poori kahani ki neev hai.

21
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:07,458
Skanda Purana Puri ko Purushottama Kshetra kehta hai.

22
00:01:07,458 --> 00:01:10,275
Kshetra yaani ek pavitra bhoomi, ek tirth.

23
00:01:10,275 --> 00:01:13,091
Granth ke anusaar Bhagwan har jagah hain.

24
00:01:13,091 --> 00:01:15,907
Phir bhi yeh kshetra sabse shreshth hai.

25
00:01:15,907 --> 00:01:19,930
Kyunki yeh jagah khud Parmeshwar ka sharir ban gayi hai.

26
00:01:19,930 --> 00:01:22,092
Zara is baat ko mehsoos kijiye.

27
00:01:22,092 --> 00:01:25,694
Granth ke liye Puri sirf mandir wala shehar nahi hai.

28
00:01:25,694 --> 00:01:27,856
Yahan ki ret, samundar ka kinara,

29
00:01:27,856 --> 00:01:30,377
sab us divya roop ka hissa hai.

30
00:01:30,377 --> 00:01:34,340
Isliye pilgrims yahan zameen ko chhoo kar maathe se lagaate hain.

31
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:37,323
Ab ek lokpriya kahani, jo dadi-nani sunati hain.

32
00:01:37,323 --> 00:01:40,680
Ek raja ko sapne mein Bhagwan ka darshan hua.

33
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:43,663
Samundar mein ek divya lakdi tairti hui aayi.

34
00:01:43,663 --> 00:01:45,901
Usi lakdi se moortiyan banaayi gayin.

35
00:01:45,901 --> 00:01:49,630
Yeh kahani pidhi dar pidhi zubaani chali aa rahi hai.

36
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:51,135
Isi wajah se Jagannath,

37
00:01:51,135 --> 00:01:54,145
Balabhadra aur Subhadra ki moortiyan lakdi ki hain.

38
00:01:54,145 --> 00:01:57,155
Pathar ya dhatu ki nahi. Bhakt kehte hain,

39
00:01:57,155 --> 00:01:59,789
yeh mandir apne niyam khud chalata hai.

40
00:01:59,789 --> 00:02:02,799
Aur yahin se shuru hote hain woh rahasya,

41
00:02:02,799 --> 00:02:04,680
jinke peeche hum aaj chalenge.

42
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:08,879
Ab granth se nikal kar napne aur jaanchne ki duniya mein chalte hain.

43
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:10,817
Archaeological Survey of India, yaani ASI,

44
00:02:10,817 --> 00:02:13,402
desh ki purani imaaraton ki dekhbhaal karta hai.

45
00:02:13,402 --> 00:02:16,632
ASI ne is mandir ko kab apne haath mein liya?

46
00:02:16,632 --> 00:02:18,570
Jawab ek saal mein chhupa hai.

47
00:02:18,570 --> 00:02:19,741
Saal tha 1975.

48
00:02:19,741 --> 00:02:23,643
ASI ne Jagannath mandir ko rashtriya sanrakshan mein le liya.

49
00:02:23,643 --> 00:02:27,546
Sanrakshan yaani imaarat ko tootne se bachana, uski marammat karna.

50
00:02:27,546 --> 00:02:30,668
Ek sarkari notification ke zariye yeh faisla hua.

51
00:02:30,668 --> 00:02:34,180
Tab se iski deewaron ki baakayda dekhbhaal hoti hai.

52
00:02:34,180 --> 00:02:37,471
ASI ke records ise sadiyon purana mandir maante hain.

53
00:02:37,471 --> 00:02:39,665
Iska dhancha Kalinga shaili ka hai.

54
00:02:39,665 --> 00:02:42,956
Kalinga shaili yaani purane Odisha ki apni khaas vaastukala.

55
00:02:42,956 --> 00:02:45,882
Ismein shikhar upar jaate jaate patla hota hai,

56
00:02:45,882 --> 00:02:47,710
jaise kisi pahaad ki choti.

57
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:51,830
Is tarah ke oonche shikhar ko Rekha Deula kehte hain.

58
00:02:51,830 --> 00:02:55,949
Deula yaani mandir ka garbhgriha aur uska shikhar. Rekha isliye,

59
00:02:55,949 --> 00:03:00,069
kyunki iski deewarein ek ghumaavdaar rekha mein upar uthti hain.

60
00:03:00,069 --> 00:03:04,600
Yahi ghumaav aage chal kar parchhai ke rahasya mein kaam aayega.

61
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:08,317
Aur is shikhar ke sabse upar baitha hai Neela Chakra.

62
00:03:08,317 --> 00:03:12,405
Yeh Bhagwan Vishnu ke Sudarshan chakra ka prateek maana jaata hai.

63
00:03:12,405 --> 00:03:16,122
ASI ke records ke mutabik yeh ashtadhatu se bana hai.

64
00:03:16,122 --> 00:03:20,210
Ashtadhatu yaani kai dhatuon ko mila kar banaya gaya ek mishran.

65
00:03:20,210 --> 00:03:22,875
Aur iska aakaar? Lagbhag 3.5 metre.

66
00:03:22,875 --> 00:03:26,428
Yaani ek lambe aadmi se bhi kaafi bada.

67
00:03:26,428 --> 00:03:30,870
Itna bhaari dhatu ka pahiya, itne oonche shikhar par. Sochiye,

68
00:03:30,870 --> 00:03:35,755
aaj ki machinon ke bina ise upar kaise pahunchaya gaya hoga.

69
00:03:35,755 --> 00:03:38,420
Yahi sawaal hum aage phir uthayenge.

70
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,562
Log batate hain,

71
00:03:39,562 --> 00:03:42,989
har roz ek sevak is shikhar par chadhta hai.

72
00:03:42,989 --> 00:03:47,178
Woh chakra ke paas purana jhanda utaarta hai, naya baandhta hai.

73
00:03:47,178 --> 00:03:49,462
Sirf haathon aur pairon ke sahaare.

74
00:03:49,462 --> 00:03:53,270
Neeche khade bhakt saans rok kar yeh nazaara dekhte hain.

75
00:03:53,270 --> 00:03:56,328
Ab pehla bada sawaal, jo har pilgrim poochta hai.

76
00:03:56,328 --> 00:03:58,706
Jhanda hawa ke ulte kyon udta hai?

77
00:03:58,706 --> 00:04:02,104
Is par bhakt aur vaigyanik alag alag baat kehte hain.

78
00:04:02,104 --> 00:04:05,501
Dono ki baat dhyan se suniye. Pehle shraddha ka pehlu,

79
00:04:05,501 --> 00:04:07,200
phir mausam vigyan ka hisaab.

80
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:10,841
Bhakton ke liye jawab seedha hai. Yeh Bhagwan ki leela hai.

81
00:04:10,841 --> 00:04:13,490
Jo jhanda prakriti ke niyam se alag chale,

82
00:04:13,490 --> 00:04:16,138
woh divya sanket hai. Kai pilgrims kehte hain,

83
00:04:16,138 --> 00:04:19,780
unhone apni aankhon se dekha hai. Ret par khade ho kar,

84
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:23,090
chehre par samundar ki hawa, aur jhanda ulti disha mein.

85
00:04:23,090 --> 00:04:26,017
Ab India Meteorological Department, yaani IMD, ki baat.

86
00:04:26,017 --> 00:04:28,577
IMD desh ka sarkari mausam vibhag hai.

87
00:04:28,577 --> 00:04:34,064
Uska kehna hai ki poorvi samundar kinare par hawa ke chhote local ghere bante hain.

88
00:04:34,064 --> 00:04:38,820
Bade mausam ke saath sea breeze aur garmi milkar yeh ghere banaate hain.

89
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:43,303
Sea breeze yaani din mein samundar se zameen ki taraf chalne wali thandi hawa.

90
00:04:43,303 --> 00:04:45,544
Shaam ko yeh aksar palat jaati hai,

91
00:04:45,544 --> 00:04:47,145
zameen se samundar ki taraf.

92
00:04:47,145 --> 00:04:50,027
Toh kinare par hawa ki disha badalti rehti hai.

93
00:04:50,027 --> 00:04:52,269
Neeche jo hawa aap mehsoos karte hain,

94
00:04:52,269 --> 00:04:54,190
upar woh alag ho sakti hai.

95
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:56,177
Ek aur wajah hai, thermal eddy.

96
00:04:56,177 --> 00:05:00,150
Thermal eddy yaani garam satah ke paas ghoomti hui hawa ki bhanwar.

97
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:03,131
Mandir ka ghumaavdaar shikhar dhoop mein garam hota hai.

98
00:05:03,131 --> 00:05:05,780
Uske aas paas hawa mudti hai, ghoomti hai.

99
00:05:05,780 --> 00:05:08,760
Upar jhanda isi ghoomti hawa ke saath lehraata hai.

100
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:10,005
Toh vaigyanik kehte hain,

101
00:05:10,005 --> 00:05:13,738
jhanda asal mein upar ki hawa ke saath hi ud raha hai.

102
00:05:13,738 --> 00:05:16,538
Bas woh hawa zameen wali hawa se ulti hai.

103
00:05:16,538 --> 00:05:19,961
Bhakt kehte hain, yeh vyakhya bhi usi leela ka hissa hai.

104
00:05:19,961 --> 00:05:22,450
Dono baatein aaj bhi saath saath chalti hain.

105
00:05:22,450 --> 00:05:24,905
Agla rahasya, parchhai ka. Log kehte hain,

106
00:05:24,905 --> 00:05:29,112
din ke kisi bhi samay mandir ki parchhai zameen par nahi dikhti.

107
00:05:29,112 --> 00:05:32,970
Dopahar ho ya shaam, shikhar ki chhaya ret par nahi girti.

108
00:05:32,970 --> 00:05:36,476
Yeh baat Puri ke har guide ki zubaan par hai.

109
00:05:36,476 --> 00:05:38,580
Par kya sach mein aisa hai?

110
00:05:38,580 --> 00:05:42,072
Kalinga vaastukala par kaam karne wale vishleshak kehte hain,

111
00:05:42,072 --> 00:05:43,623
mandir parchhai daalta hai.

112
00:05:43,623 --> 00:05:47,503
Bas woh parchhai wahan nahi girti jahan hum dhoondhte hain.

113
00:05:47,503 --> 00:05:51,382
Rekha Deula ka shikhar upar jaate jaate patla hota hai.

114
00:05:51,382 --> 00:05:53,710
Iski deewarein seedhi nahi, ghumaavdaar hain.

115
00:05:53,710 --> 00:05:56,620
Mandir ek chaudi, oonchi neev par khada hai.

116
00:05:56,620 --> 00:06:00,620
Isko podium kehte hain, yaani imaarat ke neeche ka ooncha chabutra.

117
00:06:00,620 --> 00:06:04,257
Shikhar ki parchhai pehle apne hi tiers par girti hai.

118
00:06:04,257 --> 00:06:06,803
Tiers yaani deewar ki seedhiyon jaisi parten.

119
00:06:06,803 --> 00:06:10,440
Phir chabutre ki deewaron aur aas paas ki chhaton par.

120
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:13,502
Mandir har mukhya disha ki seedh mein bana hai.

121
00:06:13,502 --> 00:06:17,925
Isliye suraj ke bade konon par chhaya andar ki taraf simat jaati hai.

122
00:06:17,925 --> 00:06:20,647
Bahar khule maidaan mein lambi parchhai nahi bichhti.

123
00:06:20,647 --> 00:06:24,389
Toh aankh ko lagta hai, parchhai gayab hai. Vishleshak kehte hain,

124
00:06:24,389 --> 00:06:26,090
woh bas chhupi hui hai.

125
00:06:26,090 --> 00:06:28,739
Bhakton ka jawab bhi suniye. Woh kehte hain,

126
00:06:28,739 --> 00:06:31,719
sadiyon pehle aisi naap tol khud ek chamatkar hai.

127
00:06:31,719 --> 00:06:35,693
Kisi ne itna sochkar shikhar banaya ki chhaya bhi andar hi rahe.

128
00:06:35,693 --> 00:06:40,660
Yahan vigyan aur shraddha jaise ek hi baat ko alag shabdon mein keh rahe hain.

129
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:42,955
Ab Neela Chakra ka rahasya. Kehte hain,

130
00:06:42,955 --> 00:06:44,922
Puri mein kahin se bhi dekho,

131
00:06:44,922 --> 00:06:48,201
chakra aapki taraf hi mukh kiye dikhta hai. Purab se,

132
00:06:48,201 --> 00:06:50,168
paschim se, kisi bhi gali se.

133
00:06:50,168 --> 00:06:53,119
Jaise woh har bhakt ko seedha dekh raha ho.

134
00:06:53,119 --> 00:06:56,070
Bachche bhi ghoom ghoom kar yeh khel khelte hain.

135
00:06:56,070 --> 00:06:58,852
ASI ke records ek dilchasp baat batate hain.

136
00:06:58,852 --> 00:07:02,678
Chakra ka bahari ghera har mukhya disha ki taraf khula hai.

137
00:07:02,678 --> 00:07:07,199
Iska dhancha aisa hai ki har taraf se woh lagbhag ek jaisa dikhe.

138
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:09,286
Toh geometry yaani aakaar ka ganit,

139
00:07:09,286 --> 00:07:11,720
is ehsaas mein badi bhoomika nibhaata hai.

140
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:15,023
Phir bhi bhakt ke liye yeh sirf dhatu ka pahiya nahi.

141
00:07:15,023 --> 00:07:16,824
Neela Chakra par jhanda bandhta hai,

142
00:07:16,824 --> 00:07:19,226
aur door se hi log pranaam karte hain.

143
00:07:19,226 --> 00:07:21,627
Kai pilgrims mandir ke andar nahi ja paate.

144
00:07:21,627 --> 00:07:24,930
Unke liye chakra ka darshan hi poora darshan maana jaata hai.

145
00:07:24,930 --> 00:07:28,825
Ab chaliye mandir ki rasoi mein, jahan Mahaprasad banta hai.

146
00:07:28,825 --> 00:07:31,941
Mahaprasad yaani Bhagwan ko chadhaya gaya pavitra bhojan.

147
00:07:31,941 --> 00:07:36,226
Yahan mitti ke matke ek ke upar ek rakh kar lakdi

148
00:07:36,226 --> 00:07:38,563
ki aanch par pakaye jaate hain.

149
00:07:38,563 --> 00:07:40,900
Aur yahin hai ek aur rahasya.

150
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:42,774
Rasoi ke sevak kehte hain,

151
00:07:42,774 --> 00:07:45,772
sabse upar wala matka sabse pehle pakta hai.

152
00:07:45,772 --> 00:07:49,145
Jabki aag sabse neeche hai. Ulta lagta hai na?

153
00:07:49,145 --> 00:07:53,642
Centre for Culinary Heritage Documentation ne is par bahas darj ki hai.

154
00:07:53,642 --> 00:07:57,390
Ek taraf rasoiye ka anubhav, doosri taraf physics ke sawaal.

155
00:07:57,390 --> 00:08:00,105
Physicists kehte hain, yeh convection ka khel hai.

156
00:08:00,105 --> 00:08:04,178
Convection yaani garam bhaap ka upar uthna aur garmi saath le jaana.

157
00:08:04,178 --> 00:08:06,214
Mitti ke matke chhidradaar hote hain,

158
00:08:06,214 --> 00:08:08,250
yaani unmein bareek chhed hote hain.

159
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:10,626
Bhaap in chhedon se upar uthti hai,

160
00:08:10,626 --> 00:08:13,680
aur poora dher ek bhatti jaisa ban jaata hai.

161
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:16,930
Is bhatti mein garmi kis kram mein pahunchti hai,

162
00:08:16,930 --> 00:08:19,096
is par abhi bhi bahas hai.

163
00:08:19,096 --> 00:08:22,346
Rasoiye apni baat par atal hain. Vaigyanik kehte hain,

164
00:08:22,346 --> 00:08:24,873
naap ke bina nishchit kehna mushkil hai.

165
00:08:24,873 --> 00:08:28,123
Aur Singhadwara par samundar ki awaaz ka chup hona?

166
00:08:28,123 --> 00:08:30,650
Uska koi naap abhi hamare saamne nahi.

167
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:34,319
Ab woh baatein jo aaj bhi koi nahi jaanta.

168
00:08:34,319 --> 00:08:38,396
Itna bhaari chakra itne oonche shikhar par kaise chadhaya gaya?

169
00:08:38,396 --> 00:08:42,880
Madhyakaal ke us engineering tareeke ka koi poora record nahi milta.

170
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:46,142
Na koi naksha, na koi likha hua hisaab.

171
00:08:46,142 --> 00:08:48,180
Yeh sawaal abhi khula hai.

172
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:51,379
Aur ek khula sawaal, shikhar ke upar ki hawa.

173
00:08:51,379 --> 00:08:53,157
Wahan hawa kaise ghoomti hai,

174
00:08:53,157 --> 00:08:56,000
iska poora vaigyanik model abhi tak nahi bana.

175
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:59,200
Model yaani computer par hawa ki chaal ka hisaab.

176
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:03,110
Jab tak woh nahi banta, jhande ki poori kahani adhoori hai.

177
00:09:03,110 --> 00:09:06,326
Aaj aap Puri jaayein toh kya dekh sakte hain?

178
00:09:06,326 --> 00:09:09,542
Samundar kinare khade ho kar jhande ki disha dekhiye.

179
00:09:09,542 --> 00:09:11,686
Phir chehre par hawa mehsoos kijiye.

180
00:09:11,686 --> 00:09:13,830
Dopahar ko mandir ki parchhai dhoondhiye.

181
00:09:13,830 --> 00:09:17,760
Aur Neela Chakra ko alag alag galiyon se dekhiye, khud parakhiye.

182
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:21,496
Mandir ki mazboot pathar ki deewarein aaj bhi khadi hain.

183
00:09:21,496 --> 00:09:24,484
Inki dekhbhaal 1975 se ASI kar raha hai.

184
00:09:24,484 --> 00:09:27,846
Singhadwara ki taraf badhte hue samundar ki awaaz suniye.

185
00:09:27,846 --> 00:09:31,209
Khud tay kijiye ki aapko kya mehsoos hota hai.

186
00:09:31,209 --> 00:09:33,450
Sabut aapke saamne hoga, faisla aapka.

187
00:09:33,450 --> 00:09:37,012
Toh aapko kaunsa rahasya sabse zyada khinchta hai? Ulta jhanda,

188
00:09:37,012 --> 00:09:39,505
chhupi parchhai, ya har taraf dekhta chakra?

189
00:09:39,505 --> 00:09:41,642
Comment mein bas ek shabd likhiye.

190
00:09:41,642 --> 00:09:43,778
Aur agar aap Puri gaye hain,

191
00:09:43,778 --> 00:09:47,340
toh zaroor bataiye ki aapne apni aankhon se kya dekha.

192
00:09:47,340 --> 00:09:51,131
Agli baar hum chalenge Gujarat ke samundar kinare, Dwarka.

193
00:09:51,131 --> 00:09:55,765
Kehte hain wahan ek poora nagar paani mein samaa gaya. Gotakhor,

194
00:09:55,765 --> 00:09:58,714
yaani divers, wahan kya dhoondh kar laaye?

195
00:09:58,714 --> 00:10:02,927
Aur us par vaigyanik kya kehte hain? Sabut ke saath,

196
00:10:02,927 --> 00:10:05,033
agli kahani mein milte hain.
